Subject: [PATCH] feat(router): 2225 set_default_github_repo rail op, a
 Settings pointer that writes nothing

The second shape of 2225: 'Set my default GitHub repository to owner/name' classified
to execution/set_default_github_repo with no handler. The op is now an action-triggered
WorkflowEntry whose handler returns CXO's line and reads/writes nothing. Axes declared
READ x PRIVATE as the handler behaves now (Arch 16:23). Catalog ledger appended; render
diff main to candidate is exactly the one new op line. EXEMPT row in the 2151 forcing
test is for Arch to review.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
